---
import MainLayout from "../layout/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Jakub Olszewski's about">
  <div class="w-6/12 mx-auto">
    <section>
      <h1 class="text-5xl">About</h1>
      <img
        src="/images/studyfront-project-image.png"
        width="500"
        class="my-2 shadow-md drop-shadow-[10px_10px_10px_rgba(1,1,1,0.2)]"
        alt=""
      />
      <p>
        I’m [Your Name], a web developer who builds fast, accessible web
        applications and reliable backend services. I focus on creating clean
        user interfaces and scalable APIs that allow products to grow and evolve
        over time.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>What I Build</h2>
      <p>
        I primarily work in the modern JavaScript ecosystem, building
        component-driven interfaces and backend services that support
        interactive web applications.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Tech highlights</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>HTML</li>
        <li>CSS</li>
        <li>JavScript</li>
        <li>React</li>
        <li>Node.js</li>
        <li>Express</li>
        <li>MongoDB</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Selected Projects</h2>
      <div>
        <h3>Project One</h3>
        <p>
          A full-stack web application that demonstrates API integration,
          authentication, and responsive interface design.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Project Two</h3>
        <p>
          A frontend-driven project focused on building reusable UI components
          and clean user interaction patterns.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Project Three</h3>
        <p>
          A backend-focused application showcasing API design, database
          interaction, and server-side logic.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>How I Work</h2>
      <p>
        My development approach prioritizes simplicity, maintainability, and
        performance. I aim to write modular code, design clear APIs, and build
        components that are easy to reuse and extend. I also value
        accessibility, responsive design, and predictable application behavior
        across browsers and devices.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Experience</h2>
      <p>
        Web developer with experience building modern web applications using
        JavaScript-based technologies. Projects include both frontend interfaces
        and backend APIs designed to support scalable applications.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Social Proof & Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you are interested in collaborating or learning more about my work,
        feel free to reach out.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>GitHub: **[GitHub profile link]**</li>
        <li>LinkedIn: **[LinkedIn profile link]**</li>
        <li>Email: **[email address]**</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
